{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":4678284,"known_for_department":"Visual Effects","name":"Anna Wróblewska-Dzwoniarek","original_name":"Anna Wróblewska-Dzwoniarek","popularity":0.1249,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/koUGpKSBs8Z2ke00GgvPDtpT2vi.jpg","id":79632,"title":"Tytus, Romek i A'Tomek wśród złodziei marzeń","original_title":"Tytus, Romek i A'Tomek wśród złodziei marzeń","overview":"On the planet Transformation, the cruel Prince Saligia steals people’s dreams and turns them into advertisements. When the fame of Tytus reaches him, Saligia lures Tytus and his old friends A’Tomek and Romek to his world, where the friends are captured by the prince’s soldiers and only Tytus’s wits stand between them and despair.","poster_path":"/hFkZR86ID6SUZrXGQyPz4JCQj.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[16,10751,12,35,878],"popularity":0.634,"release_date":"2002-03-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.1,"vote_count":6},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/XO2fyCB6UXhDcbmhFE32p0KpA.jpg","id":279562,"title":"Mister Blot's Triumph","original_title":"Tryumf pana Kleksa","overview":"Tomek Milkowski is an comic-books' illustrator. But his chef doesn't like his drawings. He tells Tomek to make up something really cool, if the boy doesn't want to loose his job. The illustrator has a guest. It's a bird Tri-Tri from stories about Mr. Kleks. Tomek takes the book and decides to illustrate it as a comic book.","poster_path":"/bjA2x66hiHGFww3Z7W8KO2rrW9y.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[10751,16,12,14,10402],"popularity":1.1124,"release_date":"2001-10-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.75,"vote_count":4}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":1}